WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.002
Is it a miracle?

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:04.504
Team U.S.A. looks like dads
that tried to get away from

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:07.257
their family for a weekend and
wound up winning The Olympics.

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:10.010
The United States has won curling gold.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:12.595
It was the miricurl on ice.

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:15.724
Go in the hole!

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:18.893
We have a lot of confidence.

00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:19.686
Get up, son!

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.939
If we come and play how
we're capable of playing,

00:00:22.939 --> 00:00:24.399
we have a great chance of winning.

00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:25.400
They got it!

